                <pb facs="0508" n="438" sameAs="frus:frus1934v04/pg438"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">713.1311/250: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lawton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-17T12:00:00-06:00">February 17,
                        1934—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 2:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Foreign Office has just notified me that Conference will meet March 15.
                    Repeated to Central American missions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lawton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
